#: docs/zh/guides/build-and-consume.md:8
msgid "构建与消费"
msgstr "Build and consume"

#: docs/zh/guides/build-and-consume.md:10
msgid "生产库由 C11 编译器和 CMake 3.24 或以上构建。从 xgen-link 仓库根目录执行下列命令。默认构建只生成静态库和匹配的配置头。"
msgstr ""
"Build the production library with a C11 compiler and CMake 3.24 or later. Run these commands from the "
"xgen-link repository root. The default build produces the static library and matching configuration "
"header."

#: docs/zh/guides/build-and-consume.md:18
msgid ""
"检查安装前缀中的公开头、静态库和 `xglConfig.cmake`。保留库与同一产物的生成头。不同编译器、目标 ABI、profile 或资源组合使用独立构建目录和前缀。多配置生成器按同一个 "
"`--config` 构建和安装，Debug 与 Release 分别安装到各自前缀。"
msgstr ""
"Inspect the install prefix for the public headers, the static library and `xglConfig.cmake`. Use the "
"generated header and library from the same build. Use separate build directories and prefixes for "
"different compilers, target ABIs, profiles or resource selections. With a multi-config generator, use "
"the same `--config` for build and install. Install Debug and Release into separate prefixes."

#: docs/zh/guides/build-and-consume.md:20
msgid "CMake 消费"
msgstr "CMake consumption"

#: docs/zh/guides/build-and-consume.md:22
msgid ""
"从源代码装配时，父工程先确定工具链和所需的 [编译档位](../reference/profiles.md)，再调用 `add_subdirectory(path/to/xgen-"
"link)`。安装消费使用以下入口。两种入口均提供 `xgl::xgl`。"
msgstr ""
"For source composition, the parent selects the toolchain and [build profile](../reference/profiles.md), "
"then calls `add_subdirectory(path/to/xgen-link)`. Use the following entry for an installed SDK. Both "
"entries provide `xgl::xgl`."

#: docs/zh/guides/build-and-consume.md:29
msgid ""
"在消费工程配置时通过 `CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH` 指定 SDK 前缀。安装包按编译能力选择 `COMPONENTS`，其中 `wire` 和 `reliable` "
"适用于所有档位。成功配置后再编译并运行实际消费者。"
msgstr ""
"Set `CMAKE_PREFIX_PATH` to the SDK install prefix when configuring the consumer. Installed packages "
"accept `COMPONENTS` for compiled capabilities. All profiles support `wire` and `reliable`. Compile and "
"run the actual consumer after it configures successfully."

#: docs/zh/guides/build-and-consume.md:31
msgid "同一 CMake 作用域可重复查找已经绑定的 SDK 前缀。需要切换前缀时使用新的消费者构建目录，确保 `xgl::xgl` 的归档和头文件都来自本次选择的 SDK。"
msgstr ""
"Repeat a lookup in the same CMake scope using the already bound SDK prefix. To switch prefixes, "
"configure a fresh consumer build so the archive and headers of `xgl::xgl` both come from the selected "
"SDK."

#: docs/zh/guides/build-and-consume.md:33
msgid "编译资源选项"
msgstr "Compiled resource options"

#: docs/zh/guides/build-and-consume.md:35
msgid "裸机 Boot 示例配置使用 `cmake --preset boot`，生成器为 Ninja。若同一镜像需要固定 RTO 和编译窗口 1，使用独立构建目录并显式选择资源："
msgstr ""
"The bare-metal Boot example configuration uses `cmake --preset boot` with Ninja. For a compiled capacity"
" of one window slot and fixed RTO, choose the resources explicitly in a separate build directory:"

#: docs/zh/guides/build-and-consume.md:44
msgid "资源身份及窗口、可靠索引桶、帧长上限、读取块和扩展运行时选项见[编译档位](../reference/profiles.md)。目标板还需选定实际交叉工具链及应用容量。"
msgstr ""
"See [Build profiles](../reference/profiles.md) for the resource identity and window, reliable index, "
"frame ceiling, read chunk and advanced runtime options. For real hardware, also select the cross "
"compiler and the application capacities."

#: docs/zh/guides/build-and-consume.md:46
msgid "主机验证"
msgstr "Host validation"

#: docs/zh/guides/build-and-consume.md:48
msgid ""
"显式准备包含 GoogleMock 的 GoogleTest 1.16.0。`prepare` 输出与当前编译器相符的 `GTest_DIR` 路径，配置消费已安装包。也可提供同版本、同工具链的独立安装。"
msgstr ""
"Explicitly prepare GoogleTest 1.16.0 with GoogleMock. The prepare step prints the `GTest_DIR` path for "
"the current compiler, and configuration uses that installed package. An independent installation is also"
" supported when its version and toolchain match."

#: docs/zh/guides/build-and-consume.md:57
msgid ""
"使用 `boot-host-test`、`embedded-lite-host-test` 或 `embedded-host-test` 验证对应能力。C11 "
"示例、无堆检查、文档及发布验证各自显式开启。完整验证流程见[开发工作流](../development/workflow.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Use `boot-host-test`, `embedded-lite-host-test` or `embedded-host-test` for the corresponding "
"capabilities. C11 examples, no-heap checks, documentation and release validation each require explicit "
"selection. See the [development workflow](../development/workflow.md) for the complete verification "
"path."
